 "rule": "The submission says four hardening commits only\n   added constraints and that one repair commit (8ab30f9) \"modified 11\n   constraints in place\". Here every corpus-touching commit from the\n   submission pin to the dev pin is compared with its first parent, scenario by\n   scenario, with one explicit rule:\n\n     a constraint is one entry of `constraints.required` or `constraints.specified`,\n     identified by its canonical JSON (sorted keys). Per scenario, with O the\n     multiset before and N the multiset after:\n       removed = O - N,  added = N - O  (multiset differences),  delta = |N| - |O|.\n     Each removed entry is one of three kinds, by what stands at its list and\n     position afterwards:\n       edited in place         an added entry with the same predicate name\n       replaced                an added entry with a different predicate name\n       deleted                 no added entry at that position\n     A scenario whose list became shorter is counted separately.\n\n   All counts are reported for every commit. Nothing is adjusted to return 11.",
